6. Convert the following entry-controlled `for` loop into an equivalent `while` loop in Java:
```java
int product = 1;
for (int i = 1; i <= 5; i++) {
    product *= i;
}
System.out.println("Factorial = " + product);
```

questions.answer:
**Equivalent `while` loop:**
```java
int product = 1;
int i = 1;
while (i <= 5) {
    product *= i;
    i++;
}
System.out.println("Factorial = " + product);
```
**Output:** `Factorial = 120`.

